-    $$o(y, z) = (M_y \times z) + y$$
-    Store these in array `O` [S1, unofficial].
-3.  **Identify Non-Empty Cells:** Iterate through scene items. For each item intersecting cell $i=(x,y,z)$, mark the corresponding bit in a temporary bit array $b_H$ at index $h(x,y,z)$ [S1, unofficial].
